OL,3,GNEWSAIndependent bookshop closing after
OL,4,Arise in bills
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn independent bookshop described as
OL,7,Fbeing a "haven" for families and
OL,8,Fneurodivergent children has announced
OL,9,Fit will close after 14 years.
OL,11,FThe Chicken and Frog says it will leave
OL,12,FBrentwood town centre in January after
OL,13,Fa huge increase in its bills and
OL,14,Fbusiness rates.
OL,16,FOwner Natasha Radford, aka "Mrs
OL,17,FChicken", also says the town's footfall
OL,18,Fhas been so low that at times she has
OL,19,Fgone a whole day without a sale.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
