OL,3,GNEWSAIndependent bookshop closing after
OL,4,Arise in bills
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 53-year-old said she had been busy
OL,7,Fsince announcing the news, with
OL,8,Fcustomers coming in for a hug and a
OL,9,Ffarewell.
